      { label: 'Real-Time & Event-Driven', desc: 'Anypoint Platform event-driven patterns using Anypoint MQ and Salesforce Platform Events for real-time data propagation.' },
      { label: 'Monitoring & Error Handling', desc: 'Proactive error notifications, dead-letter queue management, and Anypoint Monitoring dashboards so issues surface before customers notice.' },
